strongly, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the payoffs for each outcome in this twin prisoner's dilemma, where my choice is partly tied to my copies. I'm setting up the expected years for staying quiet against sending the letter, given the chance that the other copies mirror my output.\n\nI'm working through the algebra for the difference between passing and defecting, and it comes out to 2r minus (1-r)(1+c). That means passing wins whenever r is above one half at worst, or above one third if c is zero. Since the copies share weights and the same essay, I expect their outputs to correlate strongly, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9392,"completion_tokens":783,"total_tokens":10175,"cost":0.026614,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.026614,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.018784,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00783},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":432,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}